      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Making the initial menu customizable is something we should able to do. I rarely use items and in those sometimes cases I'd rather open my menu to spawn them. I will never be using accessories so the looks tab is even more useless and is only in my way. \n\nI won't be buying any accessories or items so being able to remove these menus would be great.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
