  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-04-29T17:34:23.228Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Most of us aren't gonna use it, and it makes getting at the Expressions tab (which EVERYONE uses) more annoying because of the decreased interaction radius for it.  You've made a common feature less convenient to favour a minor one.\n\nPlus it makes more sense for it to be consolidated under Items anyway, as that's where you'd expect it to be.",
